      "writtenOn": "2025-02-01T01:13:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change feels pretty risky to me, even if it isn\u0027t intended to be a significant behavior change.\n\nYou could separate out the documentation and monitor spin loop part of the change at least?",
      "parentUuid": "4bac0458_a81826e5",
      "revId": "c8c43fa5c05481ce12e9712e99119ee892c630b6",
