      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this mean \u003cdo high priority stuff\u003e can reenter app code? If so, what if the app lowers the priority? We won\u0027t overwrite that value here, but still, a more or less large portion of the high priority stuff will then be executed at a lower priority than we intended, which also isn\u0027t great. right?",
