      "message": "I don\u0027t expect that to happen. Clarified. The problem is with runtime code, like GC code, that can block other threads, including high priority ones, indefinitely. Currently, explicitly running the garbage collector from a low-priority thread is a very subtle way to shoot yourself in the foot.",
